+### Recommendations and Forecasting
+
+#### [Microsoft Recommenders](https://github.com/recommenders-team/recommenders)
+> **Description:** Microsoft Recommenders is a practical library of best practices for building recommendation systems, with examples, evaluation workflows, and production-minded guidance rather than just isolated algorithms. That makes it useful for ecommerce teams working on upsell modules, home-page personalization, related products, ranking experiments, or content recommendations. The repository combines notebooks, utilities, and reference implementations that help teams move from experimentation to more reproducible recommendation pipelines. It is especially valuable if you need a broad toolbox for collaborative filtering, ranking, evaluation, and operationalization while staying within a MIT-licensed codebase that is readable and heavily used by practitioners.
+
